      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَدْلَةٌ</span></b>  fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَدْلٌ</span> [q. v.]. (JK, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also
<i>A grape that is small and worthless by reason of
blight,</i> or <i>the like, and want of moisture.</i> (AHát,
K * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And The <i>stem of the tree called</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاب</span>, (M, K,) which is a sort of bitter tree;
(TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُدْلَةٌ</span></b> . (M, K.)

